> If you send me a description of that graph (or the construction code that leads to this `ds`), I can help simplify it. Common culprits:
> 
> - Stacking many per-region datasets incorrectly (e.g., re-reading whole files for each point).
> - Using xarray apply_ufunc without proper core-dim declaration, causing hidden broadcasting and large temporary arrays.
> - Accessing from a global DEM/accumulation grid and then “sampling” too late in the pipeline instead of early.
> 
> ---
